# Plumecreed Escort {1}{U}, flash, flying: "When this creature enters, target creature you control gains hexproof until end of turn"
# (CR 702.8a, 702.11b, 608.2b). On turn 2 Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot1's Ornithopter; in response Bot1 flashes in the Escort
# (two Mox Sapphires) and its trigger targets the Ornithopter. The trigger resolves first, the Ornithopter has hexproof from then on,
# so on resolution the Bolt's only target is illegal and it is countered: the Ornithopter takes no damage and survives.

